<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span></p>
  <p>The Curriculum Review Committee of the Faculty Senate has approved the following:</p>

  <h3>UNDERGRADUATE PROGRAM REQUEST:</h3>

  <p>SUBMITTED BY THE SCHOOL OF FISHERIES AND OCEAN SCIENCES</p>
  <p>(Submitted by <span data-field="submitter_name">{{ submitter_name }}</span>)</p>
  <p>1-Trial: <span data-field="trial_course_code">{{ trial_course_code }}</span> - Field Techniques in Marine Science, <span data-field="credits">{{ credits }}</span> credits (1.5+4.5); MAYmester course for <span data-field="year">{{ year }}</span>; prerequisites of <span data-field="prereq_code_1">{{ prereq_code_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="prereq_code_2">{{ prereq_code_2 }}</span>; letter-graded; course augments the Minor in Marine Science; effective for MAYmester upon approval.</p>

  <p>Effective: Spring <span data-field="effective_year">{{ effective_year }}</span> upon approval.</p>
  <p>Rationale: See request attached.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="width: 45%; float: left;">
      <p>APPROVED:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Chancellor's/Provost's Office</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; float: right;">
      <p>DATE:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="width: 45%; float: left;">
      <p>DISAPPROVED:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Chancellor's/Provost's Office</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; float: right;">
      <p>DATE:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>